    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89474" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσκαθ-ίστημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>supply</i> labour <i>besides</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐλλείποντα σώματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PPetr.</u>
					2p.7
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>; <i>appoint besides</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατηγόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					13.80
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Num.</u>
				7
			</span></i>:—also in aor.
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καινὰ ἕτερα [τέλη</span>]
				<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				66.8
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>arrange besides</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐν Πόντῳ προσκατεστήσατο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					42.46
				</span></i>
			.</div>
